## 数据库设计建议

### shares 表

```sql
CREATE TABLE shares (
    share_id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
    share_code VARCHAR(6) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    share_type VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL,
    creator_user_id BIGINT NOT NULL,
    payload JSONB NOT NULL,
    created_at TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
    
    CONSTRAINT fk_creator FOREIGN KEY (creator_user_id) 
        REFERENCES users(user_id) ON DELETE CASCADE
);

-- 索引
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_shares_code ON shares(share_code);
CREATE INDEX idx_shares_creator ON shares(creator_user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_shares_type ON shares(share_type);
CREATE INDEX idx_shares_created_at ON shares(created_at DESC);
```

**字段说明**：
- `share_id`：主键，UUID
- `share_code`：6位分享码，唯一索引
- `share_type`：分享类型（location/moment/group/user）
- `creator_user_id`：创建者用户ID
- `payload`：JSONB 字段，存储类型特定数据
- `created_at`：创建时间

